sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant IDP as IdP
    participant GW as Gateway
    participant FS as Firestore
    participant AE as Agent Engine
    participant RS as Redeem service
    participant TL as Tool
    U->>IDP: sign in
    IDP-->>U: JWT with sub, tenant_id, role
    U->>GW: request + JWT
    GW->>GW: verify signature, issuer, audience, expiry
    GW->>FS: rate-limit counters (user, tenant)
    GW->>GW: read directory (role, access group)
    GW->>FS: create per-turn handle (120 s, 5 uses, no token stored)
    GW->>AE: call as gateway service account with identity + handle
    AE->>RS: redeem handle for tool audience (engine service account only)
    RS->>FS: decrement remaining_uses (transaction)
    RS-->>AE: short-lived token for this tool audience
    AE->>TL: tool call with scoped token
    TL->>TL: verify token, apply tenant and role filters
    TL-->>AE: only data this user may see
    GW->>FS: delete handle at end of turn
